OL,5,G1300 Flipping Bangers
OL,6,     FGolf: Will and Gus head to the
OL,7,     FWest Country to buy a Golf GTI.
OL,8,     FGus hates it on sight, but Will is
OL,9,     Fsmitten. They soon discover why
OL,10,     Fthe car is laid up - it has no
OL,11,     Fengine.
